  "details": "its a minor feedback.\n\nafter successfully finishing the verification, add a button to get back to the vrc home or close the tab.\n\nyou as the site giving me the user the option of \"yes we are done here close me now\" just reassures that everything worked fine.\n\nMe needing to kill the tab in my browser feels like I still could mess it up, since I need to press the button that usually cancels and aborts such processes.\n\nso giving me a intended path forward instead of a dead end probaply helps a few people .(especially those who don't read and just klick buttons)",
